**/node_modules
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
corpus
docs
# The documentation SITE is not product runtime. Excluding it here keeps it
# out of the builder's `COPY apps ./apps`, so the image's `turbo build` never
# discovers the workspace — its (heavy, Astro) deps are deliberately never
# installed by the manifest-glob `npm ci` in the deps stage (brief 51).
apps/docs
# Local env files can hold secrets and were being baked into the dev image by
# `COPY apps ./apps`. They also pointed the container at services on the host's
# localhost, which inside the container is the container itself. Runtime
# configuration reaches a container through compose (`env_file`,
# `environment`), never through the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
